    "sections": {
        "description": "Food Studio is a modern Restaurant WordPress Theme designed for restaurants, cafés, bistros, bakeries, coffee shops, food trucks, pizzerias, catering services, bars, and fine dining establishments. It can also be easily adapted for food bloggers, chefs, meal delivery businesses, and other food-related websites. The theme includes professionally crafted layouts and is fully compatible with WooCommerce, Elementor, Contact Form 7, Jetpack, Yoast SEO, Google Analytics, and many other popular WordPress plugins. Built for speed and performance, Food Studio is lightweight and installs quickly with just a few clicks. Its fully responsive and mobile-friendly design ensures a seamless browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. The theme also offers extensive customization options, clean and optimized code, advanced typography, a sticky navigation menu, custom logo upload, featured header image, Bootstrap framework, SEO-friendly architecture, and translation support with WPML and Polylang, making it the perfect solution for creating a professional and engaging restaurant website. Check the demo of Designexo Pro https://themearile.com/designexo-pro-theme/."
    },
